# Copy to .env.local to run against a local arena-api backend (the only mode that exists now -
# mock/preview data mode was removed entirely in MARATHON-FE-2 Step C).

NEXT_PUBLIC_ARENA_DATA=api
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8081/api/v1

# Dormant unless set - Sentry disabled entirely without a DSN (see src/instrumentation-client.ts).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=local

# Dormant unless set - GoogleSignInButton renders nothing without this (safe to be public, no
# client secret involved - see the component's own comment). Must match arena-api's GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Login card (src/components/login/flags.ts): the Mobile OTP tab stays hidden until arena-api can
# really send an SMS (MSG91 keys set + DLT approved). Set to 1 then; Mobile becomes the default tab.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGIN_MOBILE_OTP=

# Dormant unless set - /map falls back to the stylized 3D radar view without this (see
# GoogleMapView's own comment on why a real map isn't a privacy regression either way).
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# GOLIVE-PROXY.md F-PROXY (production only - leave both unset for local dev):
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL becomes the relative "/api/v1" in production (same-origin calls,
#   no CORS, first-party cookies on arena.vikisol.in) and middleware.ts rewrites them to
#   ARENA_API_ORIGIN, adding ARENA_PROXY_SECRET as the X-Arena-Proxy-Secret header arena-api's
#   trusted-proxy filter requires outside its `local` profile.
# - Never NEXT_PUBLIC_* - these are server-only secrets/config and must never reach the browser.
# ARENA_API_ORIGIN=https://api.<new-domain>
# ARENA_PROXY_SECRET=<same value as arena-api's ARENA_PROXY_SECRET>
